out.push(S('Stage 5 · Read'));
out.push(A('**1** ⚠ **The chair has not been asked to propose a reconciliation and does not.** **The group\'s terms of reference require a single list and the group has not produced one** — **and the minute says so and then puts item 2 first on the next agenda with the two positions as minuted and no addition, which is the chair declining to do the group\'s work in the minute.**'));
